#. TRANSLATORS: AgilityCourse.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Ashen Tree[/color] in Woodcutting which provide "
"[color=#FFD16D]Ashen Logs[/color] used in various areas of the game."
msgstr ""
"Schaltet den [color=#FFD16D]Aschenbaum[/color] in der Holzfällerei frei, der"
" [color=#FFD16D]Aschenholz[/color] liefert, das an vielen Stellen im Spiel "
"gebraucht wird."

#. TRANSLATORS: AgilityCourse.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Dense Cave Trail"
msgstr "Pfad der dichten Höhle"

#. TRANSLATORS: AgilityCourse.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Dense Coal Rock[/color] in Mining which is a much"
" more efficient source of [color=#FFD16D]Coal[/color]."
msgstr ""
"Schaltet den [color=#FFD16D]dichten Kohlefelsen[/color] im Bergbau frei, "
"eine deutlich ergiebigere Quelle für [color=#FFD16D]Kohle[/color]."

#. TRANSLATORS: AgilityCourse.DisplayName
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid "Torag Grounds Trail"
msgstr "Pfad der Torag-Gründe"

#. TRANSLATORS: AgilityCourse.Description
#: Data/Packages/MelvorBase.json
msgid ""
"Unlocks the [color=#FFD16D]Torag Grounds[/color] Location in Hunting, "
"allowing you to hunt [color=#FFD16D]Torag[/color] which drop materials for "
"high-level gear."
msgstr ""
"Schaltet den Ort [color=#FFD16D]Torag-Gründe[/color] in der Jagd frei. Dort "
"kannst du [color=#FFD16D]Torag[/color] jagen, die Materialien für "
"hochstufige Ausrüstung fallen lassen."

