msgid "When using Astral Offerings"
msgstr "Bei Verwendung astraler Opfergaben"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/astral_offerings_description.tscn
msgid ""
"Created items have a chance to be destroyed based on the number of steps "
"required."
msgstr ""
"Hergestellte Gegenstände können abhängig von der Anzahl benötigter Schritte "
"zerstört werden."

#: Components/ArtisanAction/astral_offerings_description.tscn
msgid "When an item is destroyed, a gift is received instead:"
msgstr "Wird ein Gegenstand zerstört, erhältst du stattdessen eine Gabe:"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/level_reward_info.tscn
msgid "Simple Gift of Cedyr"
msgstr "Einfache Gabe des Ceedyr"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "When using the Sacrificial Anvil"
msgstr "Bei Verwendung des Opferambosses"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "All outputs are destroyed upon creation."
msgstr "Alle Erzeugnisse werden bei der Herstellung zerstört."

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "The sale value of each destroyed item is gained instead."
msgstr ""
"Stattdessen erhältst du den Verkaufswert jedes zerstörten Gegenstands."

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "Upon recipe creation, these may also occur:"
msgstr "Bei der Herstellung eines Rezepts kann außerdem Folgendes passieren:"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "One roll per recipe creation:"
msgstr "Ein Wurf pro Rezepterstellung:"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "One roll per base recipe step:"
msgstr "Ein Wurf pro Grundrezeptschritt:"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "Gain a random Collectable item"
msgstr "Erhalte einen zufälligen Sammelgegenstand"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "Gain {0:F1}x experience"
msgstr "Erhalte {0:F1}x Erfahrung"

#: Components/ArtisanAction/sacrificial_anvil_description.tscn
msgid "Gain {0:F1}x item sale value"
msgstr "Erhalte {0:F1}x Verkaufswert"

#: Components/Characters/character_health_progress_bar.tscn
msgid "Auto Eat Threshold"
msgstr "Schwelle für automatisches Essen"

#: Components/Characters/character_health_progress_bar.tscn
#: Components/Characters/CharacterHealthProgressBar.cs.uid
msgid "Enemy's Max Hit"
msgstr "Max. Treffer des Gegners"

#: Components/Characters/stance_info_tooltip.tscn
msgid "Trains"
msgstr "Trainiert"

#: Components/Characters/stance_select_menu.tscn
msgid "Stance"
msgstr "Haltung"

#: Components/CombatAreas/area_effect_view.tscn
msgid "Area Effects"
msgstr "Gebietseffekte"

#: Components/CombatAreas/combat_areas_menu.tscn
msgid "Select an Area"
msgstr "Wähle ein Gebiet"

#: Components/CombatAreas/combat_areas_menu.tscn
msgid ""
"No Area currently selected.\n"
"Choose an Area from the left-hand side to get started."
msgstr ""
"Derzeit ist kein Gebiet ausgewählt.\n"
"Wähle links ein Gebiet aus, um loszulegen."

#: Components/CombatAreas/combat_area_button.tscn
msgid "Darkness:"
msgstr "Dunkelheit:"

#: Components/CombatAreas/combat_area_button.tscn
#: Entities/Ranching/ranching_enclosure_compact_view.tscn
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Voraussetzungen"

#: Components/CombatAreas/combat_area_button.tscn
msgid "No requirements"
msgstr "Keine Voraussetzungen"

#: Components/CombatAreas/combat_area_button.tscn
#: Entities/Combat/offensive_stats_container.tscn
#: Entities/Combat/offensive_stat_values_only_container.tscn
msgid "Light vs Darkness"
msgstr "Licht gegen Dunkelheit"

#: Components/CombatAreas/combat_area_button.tscn
msgid ""
"Your [b]Accuracy Rating[/b] & [b]Evasion Rating[/b] is reduced by "
"[b][color=orange]5%[/color][/b] per your [b]Light[/b] value below the "
"[b]Darkness[/b] value."
msgstr ""
"Deine [b]Genauigkeit[/b] und [b]Umgehung[/b] werden um "
"[b][color=orange]5%[/color][/b] pro Punkt verringert, den dein "
"[b]Licht[/b]-Wert unter dem [b]Dunkelheit[/b]-Wert liegt."

#: Components/CombatAreas/combat_area_category_button.tscn
#: Components/CombatAreas/select_combat_area_panel.tscn
msgid "{0:N0} Available"
msgstr "{0:N0} verfügbar"

#: Components/CombatAreas/combat_area_info_panel.tscn
msgid "No Area selected."
msgstr "Kein Gebiet ausgewählt."

#: Components/CombatAreas/combat_area_info_panel.tscn
msgid "Combat Area 1"
msgstr "Kampfgebiet 1"

#: Components/CombatAreas/combat_area_info_panel.tscn
msgid "View Rewards"
msgstr "Belohnungen ansehen"

#: Components/CombatAreas/combat_area_info_panel.tscn
msgid "Start Dungeon"
msgstr "Verlies starten"

#: Components/CombatAreas/enemy_always_drops_icons_view.tscn
msgid "Always drops"
msgstr "Immer erhalten"

#: Components/CombatAreas/enemy_loot_table_icon_view.tscn
msgid "Chance for one of these"
msgstr "Chance auf eines davon"

